    "problem": "The paper highlights how existing models struggle to assess the economic costs of Arctic warming due to significant scientific disagreement over the potential speed and scale of methane release from thawing permafrost.",
    "method": "This document consists of correspondence letters and does not propose a specific method to solve a problem; instead, it presents a debate and commentary on the economic and climatic impacts of methane release in the Arctic, the distribution of these impacts, and an unrelated historical note on brain stimulation.",
    "task": "This correspondence debates the likelihood, speed, and economic consequences of a massive methane release from the thawing Arctic, critiquing and expanding upon the models used to assess its impact.",
